          "message": {
            "text": "Expanded macOS arm64 DPR1 evidence is 174/174 logically exact, with zero warnings and zero inert raster pairs. The collector now observes the selected webfont bytes and requested axes, source-outline identities, CDP custom-font ownership, and renderer-emitted baseline/matrix/synthetic paint plan; the strict gate returns only envelope-unratified. DPR2 and both three-OS proposal/validation jobs remain intentionally unclaimed.",
            "markdown": "Expanded macOS arm64 DPR1 evidence is 174/174 logically exact, with zero warnings and zero inert raster pairs. The collector now observes the selected webfont bytes and requested axes, source-outline identities, CDP custom-font ownership, and renderer-emitted baseline/matrix/synthetic paint plan; the strict gate returns only envelope-unratified. DPR2 and both three-OS proposal/validation jobs remain intentionally unclaimed."
